b1 is a text with value "Troubleshooting", size 40, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.03em", lineheight "1.1"
b2 is a text with value "Most problems fall into a few groups. Otter error messages name the line, say what went wrong in plain words, and often suggest a fix - start by reading them.", size 18, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.55"
b3 is a text with value "Installation and PATH", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b4 is a text with value "\"Running scripts is disabled on this system\": allow scripts for the current terminal only. It expires when you close the window.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b5 is a text with value "Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope Process Bypass", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable false
b5label is a text with value "PowerShell", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b5copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b5head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b5label, b5copy in b5head
b5block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b5head, b5 in b5block
when b5copy is clicked
    copy text of b5 to clipboard
    text of b5copy is "Copied"
.
b6 is a text with value "\"otter is not recognized as an internal or external command\": the terminal was opened before Otter was added to your PATH. Close it and open a new one. To check the PATH, run:", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b7 is a text with value "[Environment]::GetEnvironmentVariable('Path', 'User')", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable false
b7label is a text with value "PowerShell", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b7copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b7head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b7label, b7copy in b7head
b7block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b7head, b7 in b7block
when b7copy is clicked
    copy text of b7 to clipboard
    text of b7copy is "Copied"
.
b8 is a text with value "You can always run Otter by its full path, for example & \"C:\\Tools\\Otter\\otter.cmd\" hello.ot.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b9 is a text with value "Syntax errors", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b10 is a text with value "A syntax error means Otter could not read the program. It shows the line, a marker where the problem is, and a suggestion. These are the real messages:", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b11 is a text with value "Otter Syntax Error\n\nLine 1:\n    say \"Hello\n        ^\n\nThis string never closes.\n\nTry:\n    Add a closing quote.", size 14, foreground "#0f1f36", background "#e8eef7", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 16px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;"
b11label is a text with value "Output", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#4a5b75"
b11copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#c9d6e8", foreground "#0f1f36", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b11head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#dde6f2", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b11label, b11copy in b11head
b11block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b11head, b11 in b11block
when b11copy is clicked
    copy text of b11 to clipboard
    text of b11copy is "Copied"
.
b12 is a text with value "Fix: close the text with a second double quote.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b13 is a text with value "Runtime errors", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b14 is a text with value "A runtime error means the program is well formed but something went wrong while it ran.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b15 is a text with value "Otter Runtime Error\n\nLine 1:\n    say greeting\n\nOtter could not find the variable \"greeting\". It has not been given a value yet.\n\nTry:\n    greeting is 0", size 14, foreground "#0f1f36", background "#e8eef7", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 16px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;"
b15label is a text with value "Output", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#4a5b75"
b15copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#c9d6e8", foreground "#0f1f36", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b15head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#dde6f2", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b15label, b15copy in b15head
b15block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b15head, b15 in b15block
when b15copy is clicked
    copy text of b15 to clipboard
    text of b15copy is "Copied"
.
b16 is a text with value "Fix: give the variable a value before you use it. Otter never guesses that a missing variable means empty or false.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b17 is a text with value "Otter Runtime Error\n\nLine 1:\n    say 10 divided by 0\n\nI cannot divide by zero.", size 14, foreground "#0f1f36", background "#e8eef7", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 16px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;"
b17label is a text with value "Output", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#4a5b75"
b17copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#c9d6e8", foreground "#0f1f36", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b17head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#dde6f2", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b17label, b17copy in b17head
b17block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b17head, b17 in b17block
when b17copy is clicked
    copy text of b17 to clipboard
    text of b17copy is "Copied"
.
b18 is a text with value "Fix: check the divisor first, with an if, before dividing.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b19 is a text with value "Otter Runtime Error\n\nLine 4:\n    greet\n\n\"greet\" needs 1 value but was given 0.\n\nTry:\n    greet person", size 14, foreground "#0f1f36", background "#e8eef7", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 16px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;"
b19label is a text with value "Output", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#4a5b75"
b19copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#c9d6e8", foreground "#0f1f36", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b19head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#dde6f2", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b19label, b19copy in b19head
b19block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b19head, b19 in b19block
when b19copy is clicked
    copy text of b19 to clipboard
    text of b19copy is "Copied"
.
b20 is a text with value "Fix: pass every value the function asks for.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b21 is a text with value "Otter Runtime Error\n\nLine 2:\n    add 1 to score\n\nI can only add to a number or a list, but \"score\" holds some text.", size 14, foreground "#0f1f36", background "#e8eef7", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 16px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;"
b21label is a text with value "Output", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#4a5b75"
b21copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#c9d6e8", foreground "#0f1f36", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b21head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#dde6f2", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
