b22 is a text with value "Fix: make sure the variable holds a number: score is 0, not score is \"high\".", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b23 is a text with value "File errors", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b24 is a text with value "Otter Runtime Error\n\nLine 1:\n    read \"missing.txt\" into content\n\nI could not find a file called \"missing.txt\".\n\nTry:\n    if file \"missing.txt\" exists", size 14, foreground "#0f1f36", background "#e8eef7", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 16px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;"
b24label is a text with value "Output", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#4a5b75"
b24copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#c9d6e8", foreground "#0f1f36", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b24head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#dde6f2", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
