b25 is a text with value "Fix: check the name and folder, or test for the file first. Relative paths are relative to the folder you ran otter from.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b26 is a text with value "if file \"missing.txt\" exists\n    read \"missing.txt\" into content\n    say content\notherwise\n    say \"There is no missing.txt yet.\"\n.", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b26label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b26copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b26head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
