    text of nw9copy is "Copied"
.
nw10 is a text with value "Fix: hide, show, focus and clear are planned for Otter 1.1 (see the Roadmap). Otter says so instead of silently doing nothing.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
nw11 is a text with value "Otter Runtime Error\n\nLine 1:\n    start command \"echo hi\" and call it job\n\nStarting a command (\"start command ...\") is not supported on the web target. Browsers cannot run programs.", size 14, foreground "#0f1f36", background "#e8eef7", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 16px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;"
nw11label is a text with value "Output", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#4a5b75"
nw11copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#c9d6e8", foreground "#0f1f36", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
nw11head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#dde6f2", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put nw11label, nw11copy in nw11head
nw11block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put nw11head, nw11 in nw11block
